# This repository had no .gitignore at all, so every artifact the query/worker
# co-scientist loop drops here has been turning up as a landing candidate on
# every cleanup sweep (5,919 of them on 2026-09-10).
#
# Only shapes main tracks NONE of are listed. main tracks .py, .txt, .sh, .md,
# .json, .mjs and .cljs at the root and those are deliberately not matched --
# the untracked files share both the naming (_b<N>_*) and the extensions of the
# 238 tracked ones, so that corpus cannot be separated by a pattern and is left
# alone for a person to decide.
*.ttfb
*.code
*.log
*.raw
*.pyc
*.pl
*.out
*.sorted
*.tt
*.err
*.tmp
__pycache__/
# Per-run capture directories. main tracks no path with a dot-prefixed component.
/.b[0-9]*/
/.run[0-9]*_raw/
